    "id": "i-5TGTZ9P",
    "title": "One Clean Shot",
    "description": "A cinematic Western fine art portrait suspended at the edge of inevitability. The scene offers no explanation and no retreat—only resolve shaped by distance traveled, choices made, and consequences accepted. Wayne Heim’s painterly approach softens the physical world while sharpening the psychological tension, allowing ambiguity to dominate the moment. Justice, revenge, correction, or final chance—left deliberately undefined. © Wayne Heim",
