    "id": "i-ShhCNkX",
    "title": "Miles to Go",
    "description": "Wayne Heim’s painterly Western fine art photograph, featuring two riders and a young horse trekking through open country under golden light. This evocative image captures not just the journey, but the rite of passage—where green horses, seasoned cowboys, and the wild West itself shape one another. Every sun-warmed detail, from weathered tack to shifting shadows, is rendered in Heim’s distinctive painterly style.\nDiscover more Western Cowboy Portraits\n and painterly Western fine art at K4 Studios. © Wayne Heim",
