    "title": "Interruption",
    "description": "A painterly Western interior shaped by quiet tension and suspended motion. Light spills across the room as a moment of stillness gives way to awareness—something unseen pressing just beyond the frame. Wayne Heim’s cinematic approach favors implication over action, inviting the viewer into the space between calm and consequence, where ordinary moments fracture into decision. © Wayne Heim",
