    "title": "Told you to stay away from my sister!",
    "description": "Caught at the wrong end of frontier justice, this scene captures the raw drama and high-stakes tension of the Old West. A weathered cowboy stands over his rival, gun drawn, warning clear as day—some lines, and some blood, shouldn’t be crossed. Wayne Heim’s painterly fine art photography brings every grain of dust, every breathless threat, and every story-filled shadow to life. A cinematic portrait for lovers of Western art, cowboy lore, and the code of the untamed West. © Wayne Heim",
