    "title": "Dust or Desperation ",
    "description": "A fine art painterly portrait from Wayne Heim’s Western series. A lone woman, dust-streaked and weary, finds a moment’s solace inside a wagon—her face marked by fatigue and resolve. This image speaks to the covenant of survival on the trail, echoing the hardship and quiet courage that defined life in the West. © Wayne Heim",
