    "description": "A weathered cowboy leans in, finger wagging, ready to spin another yarn for anyone within earshot. Wayne Heim’s painterly fine art photography captures the heart of Western storytelling—where fact and fiction blend beneath a battered hat and a glint of mischief. With rich color and cinematic light, this image celebrates the tradition of tall tales, the warmth of company, and the myth-making spirit of the American West. © Wayne Heim",
