    "id": "i-M2WdKTL",
    "title": "Still Following",
    "description": "A painterly Western fine art photograph capturing the quiet tension of movement and separation. Wayne Heim frames a moment where direction is chosen, but consequences linger behind. Through softened textures, natural light, and cinematic distance, the image explores loyalty, instinct, and the unspoken cost of leaving something—or someone—unresolved. © Wayne Heim",
