    "id": "i-ZRFr8hd",
    "title": "Golden Silence",
    "description": "Description (SEO/Western Art)\n“Golden Silence,” a painterly fine art photograph by Wayne Heim, captures a lone prospector at dawn, searching for gold in a quiet Western stream. The composition blends solitude, hope, and the mythic spirit of the American frontier. This evocative Western art piece invites viewers to reflect on the dreams and risks that shaped the West.\n© Wayne Heim",
