    "description": "A contemplative Western fine art photograph by Wayne Heim, capturing a weathered frontiersman grounded in experience rather than myth. Rendered in a painterly style with softened light and textured atmosphere, the image reflects endurance earned through loss, survival shaped by consequence, and the quiet resolve of a man who has already paid more than his share. © Wayne Heim",
