    "title": "Who Goes There?",
    "description": "Painterly Western fine art by Wayne Heim—caught at the uneasy edge of the night, where every flicker is a question, every silence a story. For collectors who crave tension, mystery, and the hush before fate decides. © Wayne Heim",
