    "id": "i-D3HdMmb",
    "title": "Cowboy Art:  Watchful Eye",
    "description": "A painterly Western portrait capturing a lone cowboy traveler standing watch atop a moving train car. This image reflects Wayne Heim’s western themed photography approach—using cinematic light, restrained texture, and narrative composition to transform lived frontier moments into fine art. Rather than decorative nostalgia, the work emphasizes character, tension, and atmosphere, illustrating a western photography style rooted in authenticity and story. © Wayne Heim",
